{"title":"Vape in Kenya","description":"\u003cp\u003eBuy variety of vapes at [YOUR BRAND] with best vape price in Kenya. We deal in dozens of vape pod kits, e cigarettes, closed pod systems, open pod system and variety of vape mods online in Kenya.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-tenet-koko-18w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn Tenet KOKO 18W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Caliburn TENET KOKO 18W Pod System, featuring a 950mAh battery, aluminum-alloy housing, and works with Caliburn G\/G2 Pods and Coils. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell g replacement coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-empty-cartridge\" title=\"Caliburn G2 replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-replacement-coils\" title=\"Caliburn G2 replacement coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003cimg data-mce-fragment=\"1\" alt=\"uwell caliburn tenet koko infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/caliburn-tenet-koko-pod_Infographic.jpg?v=1684878329\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrafted from durable aluminum, the chassis of the Caliburn TENET KOKO Pod System offers a strong and protective chassis, safely encapsulating the 950mAh battery within. Utilizing coils and pods from the Uwell Caliburn G and G2 Series, the TENET KOKO is perfect for those that love portable pod system that deliver plenty of flavor.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Caliburn TENET KOKO 18W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 73.7mm by 50mm by 18mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 950mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage Output: 18W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Aluminum-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: Uwell Caliburn G\/G2 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Installation: Press-Fit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: Caliburn G\/G2 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn TENET KOKO\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn G2 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Caliburn G2 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Metal Lanyard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531606171703,"sku":"U Cali Tenet KOKO Pod System","price":4900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_tenet_koko_pod_system_-_grey.png?v=1741702501"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-koko-prime-15w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn Koko Prime 15W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn KOKO Prime Pod System, offering a 690mAh battery, magnetic decorative panels, and compatibility with the Caliburn G Pods and Coil Series. Constructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn KOKO Prime is ergonomic and portable, easily fitting in the hand, pocket, purse, or bookbag.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with a 2mL refillable pod from the Caliburn G, the Uwell Caliburn KOKO Prime uses the Caliburn G Coils to produce outstanding vapor and flavor with the 0.8ohm meshed coil and introduces a new 1.0ohm FeCrAl coil for those that are more flavor oriented and love the MTL aspect of vaping. Featuring an integrated 690mAh battery, the Caliburn KOKO Prime can be recharged via Type-C USB Port while providing long lasting power.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNOTE: Both the packaging have same contents in it.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell caliburn g replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell caliburn G coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"uwell caliburn koko prime infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0573\/8709\/0059\/files\/Uwell_Caliburn_Koko_Prime_Infographic.jpg?v=1648648452\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell CALIBURN KOKO PRIME 15W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 68mm by 45.6mm by 16mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 690mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax. Wattage Output: 15W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Airflow Systems\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanyard Attachment Point\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Silicone Check Valve\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm UN2 Meshed-H Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm FeCrAl Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress-Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Flavor Testing Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen-Circuit Indication\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Power Indication\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOver-Time Indication\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB Type-C Cable\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn KOKO Prime\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.0ohm Caliburn KOKO Prime Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Caliburn Koko Prime (Normal - Basic Packaging)","offer_id":41531606663223,"sku":"U Cali Koko Prime Pod System (Normal - Basic)","price":3700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Caliburn Koko Prime (Vision - Latest Packaging)","offer_id":41531606695991,"sku":"U Cali Koko Prime Pod System (Vision - Latest)","price":3700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_koko_prime_-_all_colors.png?v=1741702517"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-koko-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn Koko Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003ePresenting the UWELL Caliburn KOKO Pod System, a finely crafted vaping pod system manufactured with a integrated 520mAh rechargeable battery, Caliburn pod compatibility, and can be concealed within the palm of the hand with ease. Constructed from high quality aluminium alloy, the chassis of the UWELL Caliburn KOKO is moderately impact resistant, safely housing the 520mAh rechargeable battery and sporting an exterior matte metallic finish. In addition, the Caliburn KOKO pod system is compatible with its namesake, the 2mL refillable Caliburn Pods, featuring a dual parellel 1.2ohm coil design that vaporizes eJuice or nicotine salts with ease, delivery delicious flavors and nicotine when needed. Furthermore, the shape and style of the Caliburn KOKO pod kit is much different, offering a more concealable shape and design for better portability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuy \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-koko-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn Koko Replacements Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn Koko Replacements Pods\u003c\/a\u003e from here.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUWELL Caliburn KOKO Pod System Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 520mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 11W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 3.2-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDirect Voltage Based Output\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 1.2-1.5ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminium-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Capacity Juice Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm KOKO Coil Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Flavor Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Drip Tip Doubles as Fill Port Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3.5mm Fill Port - Dual Ports\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMinimum Fill Line on Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProprietary Gold-Plated Magnetic Snap-In Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Mechanism Fault Diagnosis\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 UWELL Caliburn KOKO\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Caliburn KOKO Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531607744567,"sku":"U Cali Koko Pod System","price":3600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_koko_pod_system_-_black.jpg?v=1741702534"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-a2s-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn A2S Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Caliburn A2S Pod System, featuring an integrated 520mAh battery, 2mL side-filled pod capacity, and integrated 1.2ohm meshed coil. Cross-compatible with the original Caliburn A2 Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2s-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn A2S Replacement Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2S Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Caliburn A2S infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/Uwell_Calibrun_A2S_Pod_Systes_-_Infographic_-min.jpg?v=1669758838\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable aluminum-alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn A2S Pod System delivers a highly portable form-factor that can easily be stored within the pocket, purse, or bookbag. Equipped with a 2mL pod, the Caliburn A2S refills via a silicone stoppered side fill system. Within the clear pod is an integrated 1.2ohm coil that delivers amazing flavor and vapor that will excite the taste buds, all from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts. Operating off a draw-activated firing mechanism, the Caliburn A2S is your next best vaping experience, packed into a powerful compact vape.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell CALIBURN A2S Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 110.1mm by 21.3mm by 11.7mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 520mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage Output: 15W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJuice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm A2S Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with 0.9ohm A2 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn A2S Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 1.2ohm Caliburn A2S Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531626946615,"sku":"U Cali A2S Pod System","price":3400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_a2s_-_pod_system_-_black.png?v=1741703122"},{"product_id":"m3-128w-vape-kit","title":"M3 128W Vape Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe M3 128W Vape Kit is an advanced vaping device that offers an exceptional vaping experience to enthusiasts and beginners alike. This sleek and powerful kit is now available in \u003ci\u003eKenya \u003c\/i\u003eat the affordable price, making it an excellent choice for those looking to enjoy a high-quality vaping experience without breaking the bank.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKEY FEATURES OF THE M3 128W VAPE KIT:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImpressive Power Output: The M3 Vape Kit boasts a maximum power output of 128 watts, allowing users to customize their vaping experience to suit their preferences.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable Build: Crafted from high-quality materials, this vape kit is designed to withstand the rigors of everyday use. Its sturdy construction ensures longevity, making it a reliable investment for vapers.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMultiple Vaping Modes: The kit offers a variety of vaping modes, including wattage mode, temperature control, and more.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLarge E-Liquid Capacity: The M3 tank included in the kit has a generous e-liquid capacity. \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSafety Features: Safety is a top priority with the M3 128W Vape Kit. It comes equipped with various protection features, such as overheat protection, short-circuit protection, and low voltage protection, ensuring a worry-free vaping experience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleek Design: With its sleek and ergonomic design, the M3 Vape Kit is not only powerful but also visually appealing. \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLong-lasting Battery: The built-in battery provides ample power to keep you vaping throughout the day.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"M3","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531627077687,"sku":"25","price":4400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/M3-128W-Vape-Kit.jpg?v=1741703146"},{"product_id":"uwell-yearn-11w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Yearn 11W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell YEARN 11W Pod System is a sleek and compact pod system, integrating a 370mAh rechargeable battery, LED battery life indicator light, and is equipped with a slew of operational and hardware safeties and protections that will guard against failure when in use. Crafted from a zinc-alloy chassis, PC, and ABS materials, the YEARN Pod System has a quality heft to the weight, without weighing down the pockets or purse.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition, the integrated 370mAh rechargeable battery is spacious enough to provide ample power for vaping without the need for charging in between sessions. On the face of the YEARN Pod System is a LED Battery Life Indicator Light, relaying the remaining battery life via colored LED light. Furthermore, the YEARN Pod System is equipped with a bunch of circuit protections and performance safeties to ensure a stable, safe, and reliable vaping system. \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote: Uwell Yearn doesn't includes pods in kit.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003eUwell YEARN 11W Pod System Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 86.7mm by 20.2mm by 10.4mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 370mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax. Wattage Output: 11W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy \u0026amp; PC ABS Material Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJuice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIsolated E-Liquid Chamber Technology - Preserves Freshness of eJuice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Flavor Testing Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Power Indication\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaping Overtime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlug 'n' Play Cartridge Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Black \u0026amp; Blue, Grey, Black \u0026amp; Violet, Black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nIncludes:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x YEARN Battery Body\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x User's Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x YEARN Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531628126263,"sku":"U Yearn Pod System","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_yearn_11w_pod_system_-_default-min.jpg?v=1741703374"},{"product_id":"uwell-yearn-neat-2-12w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Yearn Neat 2 12W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell YEARN NEAT 2 12W Pod System, featuring a 520mAh Battery, an integrated 0.9ohm UN2-Meshed H Coil, and 2mL pod capacity. Constructed in a lightweight manner, the chassis is slim and compact, housing the 520mAh battery. Featuring no buttons, the YEARN NEAT 2 works off a draw-activated firing mechanism to reduce the chances of any auto-firing. Holding up to 2mL fill within the pod, the YEARN Neat 2 pods utilizes an integrated 0.9ohm UN2 Meshed-H coil to deliver outstanding flavor with the Pro-FOCS Max Flavor Technology.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell YEARN NEAT 2 12W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 102.5mm by 22.1mm by 11.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 520mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax. Wattage Output: 12W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLightweight Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.9ohm UN2-Meshed H Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Pro-FOCS Flavor Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen-Circuit Indication\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell YEARN NEAT 2 Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.9ohm UN2-Meshed H Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531629010999,"sku":"U Yearn Neat 2 Pod System","price":3560.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_yearn_neat_2_-_pod_system_-_black.png?v=1741703386"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-ak3-13w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn AK3 13W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Uwell Caliburn AK3 13W Pod System, featuring a 520mAh battery, 1.0ohm resistance, and operates off a draw and button activated firing mechanism. Constructed from durable aluminum, the Caliburn AK3 Pod System offers a slim and portable form factor and is easy to carry around in the pocket, purse, or bookbag. In addition, the Caliburn AK3 Pod System is capable of utilizing pods from the A3 Pod Series, holding up to 2mL within the confines of the refillable PCTG Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Caliburn AK3 13W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 67.5mm by 44.1mm by 12mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 520mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Range: 13W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 1.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Aluminum-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Dual-Activation - Button \u0026amp; Draw\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: Caliburn A3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Fill - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Installation: Press-Fit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn AK3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 1.0ohm Caliburn A3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Silicone Lanyard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531659943991,"sku":"U Caliburn AK3 Pod System","price":4100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_ak3_13w_pod_system_-_cyan.png?v=1741704483"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-sky-solo-plus-vape-pen-starter-kit","title":"Vaporesso Sky Solo \u0026 Sky Solo Plus Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso SKY SOLO and SKY SOLO PLUS Starter Kit i\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003es\u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"e cigarette\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-kenya\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e e-cig\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003euser-friendly vape pen system, integrating up to 3000mAh rechargeable battery with the OMNI Board Mini Chipset with utilization of the new mesh-coil GT Cores. The Vaporesso SKY SOLO and SKY SOLO PLUS features a OMNI Board Mini Chipset within to efficiently utilize 1500mAh and 3000mAh rechargeable battery and provide dense vaporous clouds when wanted or needed. In addition, the SKY Solo utilizes coils from the GT Coil Line, making full use of the assortment of coils to provide the desired vaping style, with the compatibility with the performance QF Coil Systems, which only work for the Sky Solo Plus. The Vaporesso SKY Solo makes for a great beginners' starter kit with the all-in-one detachable design. Incorporating the tank, battery, and mod make this kit very foolproof and an ideal kit for the starting vaper. \u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e[YOUR BRAND] provides best after service to all his customers. Feel free to contact us and if required, also check our whole collection of\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\" title=\"Vape Kenya\"\u003evape kenya\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVaporesso SKY SOLO PLUS Kit -\u003cem\u003e 3000mAh Internal Battery - 8.5mL Max Capacity - 30mm Glass Diameter\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVaporesso SKY SOLO STANDARD Kit -\u003cem\u003e 1500mAh Internal Battery - 3.5mL Max Capacity - 26mm Glass Diameter\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote:\u003c\/strong\u003e Please select your desired version in the dropdown menu.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso SKY SOLO PLUS Vape Pen Starter Kit Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 130mm Height, 30mm Glass Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mm Widest Glass Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 3000mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8mL Max Tank Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOMNI Board Mini Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAll-In-One Integrated Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGT Meshed Coil System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.18ohm GT Meshed Coil - rated for 50-85W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatibility with QF Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThreaded Top Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Dual Slotted Bottom Airflow Control Ring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Single Button Operation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBurn Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercharge Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo Load Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Resistance Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eESD Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Power Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso SKY SOLO Vape Pen Starter Kit Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 103mm Height, 26mm Glass Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e26mm Widest Glass Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1500mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3.5mL Standard Tank Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOMNI Board Mini Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAll-In-One Integrated Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGT Meshed Coil System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.18ohm GT Meshed Coil - rated for 50-85W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThreaded Top Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Dual Slotted Bottom Airflow Control Ring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Single Button Operation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBurn Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercharge Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo Load Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Resistance Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eESD Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Power Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 SKY SOLO or SKY SOLO PLUS Vape Pen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.18ohm GT Meshed Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 Spare O-ring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Guide\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"SOLO PLUS","offer_id":41531764310071,"sku":"V Sky Solo Plus Kit","price":3100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"SOLO","offer_id":41531764342839,"sku":"V Sky Solo Kit","price":2700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/sky-solo-vape-pen-kenya.png?v=1741709726"},{"product_id":"uwell-sculptor-11w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Sculptor 11W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Sculptor 11W Pod System, featuring a 370mAh battery, 11W maximum output, and is equipped with a 1.2ohm mesh coil to deliver vapor.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-sculptor-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Sculptor Pods\"\u003eUwell Sculptor Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the Sculptor Pod System is visually striking but reliable, outputting delicious clouds of vapor at the slightest draw. In addition, the Sculptor Pod Kit has a lanyard attachment point to tether the Sculptor within arm's reach. Holding up to 1.6mL of eJuice or nicotine salts within the refillable pod, the Sculptor Pod System is great for beginners or advanced vapers alike.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Sculptor Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 77.1mm by 32.6mm by 15mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery: 370mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage: 11W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Zinc-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFiring: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 1.6mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill: Side Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil: Integrated 1.2ohm Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Sculptor Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 1.2ohm Sculptor Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Necklace\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531764572215,"sku":"U Sculptor Pod System","price":3900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_sculptor_-_pod_system_-_bronze.png?v=1741709754"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-xros-3-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso XROS 3 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Vaporesso XROS 3 Pod System, featuring a 1000mAh battery, 0.6-1.0ohm resistance range, and is compatible with all previous XROS variants.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-xros-replacement-pods\" title=\"Vaporesso XROS Replacement Pods\"\u003eVaporesso XROS Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eConstructed from durable stainless steel, the chassis of the XROS 3 is impervious to light falls and drops, preventing any damage to the delicate inner-workings. In addition, the 2mL refillable pods can hold and vaporize your favorite eJuices or nicotine salts and can be used with all members of the XROS family. Adopting the AXON chipset from higher end Vaporesso Starter Kits and Pod Systems, the XROS 3 Pod System is now capable of outputting in Pulse mode. This produces more stable and constant flavor, as the chipset within checks the coil multiple times per second to ensure constant power delivery.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso XROS 3 Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 115.1mm by 23.6mm by 13.7mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 1000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput: Constant Voltage Based\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.6-1.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Zinc-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Button-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: XROS 3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top - Dual Fill Ports\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMore Info: Chipset: AXON Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Vaporesso XROS 3 Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.6ohm XROS 3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.0ohm XROS 3 Mesh Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Reminder Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531765817399,"sku":"V XROS 3 Pod System","price":4100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_xros_3_pod_system_-_black_1.png?v=1741709788"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-xros-mini-16w-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso XROS Mini 16W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Vaporesso XROS MINI 16W Pod System, featuring a rechargeable 1000mAh battery, 11-16W output range, and utilizes the XROS Pod Series.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-xros-replacement-pods\" title=\"Vaporesso xros replacement pods\"\u003eVaporesso XROS Replacement Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the Vaporesso XROS Mini Pod System offers a non-slip diamond texture design. Encapsulating a large 1000mAh battery, the XROS MINI Pod System delivers superior battery to last thorughout the day and can be recharged via Type-C USB Cable. Utilizing a 1.2ohm XROS Pod, the 2mL capacity can hold your favorite eJuice or nicotine salt and is perfect for MTL vaping. Sold separately, the XROS Mini 16W Pod System can utilize the 0.8ohm Mesh Pod for restricted direct lung vaping for more versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso XROS MINI 16W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 98.9mm by 23.4mm by 13.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1000mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 11-16W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDiamond Texture Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Refillable Pod Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm XROS Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with 0.8ohm XROS Pod - Sold Separately\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Vaporesso XROS MINI Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm XROS Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C USB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531765948471,"sku":"69d25d42c6b84","price":3200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_xros_mini_black.png?v=1741709800"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-xros-16w-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso XROS 16W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Vaporesso XROS 16W Pod System, featuring a 800mAh integrated battery, mesh coil heating structure, and adjustable airflow control system. Constructed from durable zinc-alloy, the XROS Pod System delivers delicious clouds of vapor with its mesh coil pods, holding up to 2mL of e-juice or nicotine salts. Offering a 0.8ohm or 1.2ohm mesh coil, the Vaporesso XROS is top filled, removing the ergonomic mouthpiece to reveal fill ports for a convenient fill system. On the back of the Vaporesso XROS Pod System, is an adjustable airflow control switch, allowing or restricting airflow with a simple click.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso XROS 16W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAXON Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 112mm by 23mm by 13mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 800mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 11-16W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStainless Steel Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAuto-Draw or Button Firing Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 Color LED Battery Indicator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Control Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Hidden By Mouthpiece\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTransparent Juice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso XROS Pod Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm XROS Mesh Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm XROS Mesh Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOverdischarge Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo Load Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercharging Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOver Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Blue, Matte Grey, Sky Blue, Silver, Rose Pink, Rainbow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Vaporesso XROS Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm XROS Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm XROS Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C USB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Reminder Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531766014007,"sku":"V XROS Pod System","price":3100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_xros_16w_pod_system_-_all_colors.png?v=1741709811"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-xros-2-16w-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso XROS 2 16W Pod System","description":"Discover the Vaporesso XROS 2 16W Pod System, featuring a 1000mAh battery, dual firing systems, and compatibility with both the Mesh and Regular XROS Pods. Adopting a aluminum alloy chassis, the body is slim and lightweight, making the XROS 2 Pod System perfect for those traveling or on-the-go. Delivering superior vaping from the 11W or 16W output, depending on the type of pod used, the XROS 2 can last throughout the entire day and can work off a draw-to-fire or button activated firing system.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVaporesso XROS 2 16W Pod System Features:\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 112mm by 23mm by 13mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1000mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 11-16W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Firing Modes - Draw or Button Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 LED Breathing Lights\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Control Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm MESH Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm Regular Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Black, Space Grey, Silver, Grape Purple, Orange Red, Lime Green\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nIncludes:\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Vaporesso XROS 2 Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm MESH Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Regular Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C USB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531766636599,"sku":"69d25d45c0d56","price":3900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_-_xros_2_-_pod_system_-_front_side.png?v=1741709837"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-xros-nano-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso XROS Nano Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Vaporesso XROS Nano Pod System, featuring an integrated 1000mAh battery, draw-activated firing mechanism, and is compatible with XROS Pod Series. Powered by the AXON chipset, the XROS Nano Pod System is the latest installment in the XROS Pod System Series. Maintaining compatibility with the XROS Pod Series, the smaller form factor of the XROS Nano Pod System makes it a great option for those that are on-the-go or traveling. Adopting an airflow control switch, users can find the ideal amount of airflow to deliver the best flavor from their favorite eJuice or nicotine salts loaded into the 2mL pod.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-xros-replacement-pods\" title=\"Vaporesso XROS Replacement Pods\"\u003eVaporesso XROS Replacement Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"vaporesso xros nano infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0656\/8630\/7047\/files\/Vaporesso_XROS_NANO_INFOGRAPIC-min.jpg?v=1660662804\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso XROS Nano Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAXON Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 63.1mm by 48.8mm by 14.9mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1000mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.8ohm \/ 1.2ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAccurate Airflow Control Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso XROS Pod Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm XROS Pod or 1 0.7ohm XROS Mesh Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm XROS Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Silver, Space Grey, Black, Green, Yellow, Pink\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Vaporesso XROS Nano Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm XROS Mesh Pod or 1 0.7ohm XROS Mesh Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm XROS Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C USB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Lanyard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531766767671,"sku":"V XROS Nano Pod System","price":3900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_-_xros_nano_-_pod_system_-_blue.png?v=1741709852"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-zero-2-top-filling-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso Zero 2 Top Filling Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Vaporesso ZERO 2 Top-Fill Pod System, featuring an 800mAh battery and a revamped pod with a top-fill system for enhanced leakage prevention.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-renova-zero-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso Renova Zero Pod System\"\u003eVaporesso Renova Zero Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-zero-2-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso Zero 2 Vape\"\u003eVaporesso Zero 2 Pod System (Bottom Filling Pod)\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-renova-zero-pod-cartridge\" title=\"Vaporesso Renova Zero Pods\"\u003eVaporesso \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eRenova \u003c\/span\u003eZero Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-zero-2-replacement-pods\" title=\"Vaporesso zero 2 replacement pods\"\u003eVaporesso Zero 2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from a zinc-alloy material, the ZERO 2 offers a compact yet futuristic design and utilizes the AXON chipset for consistent vapor output. Take steady draws via draw-activation for a natural vaping experience and enjoy your favorite nicotine salts from this spaceship-esque pod system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso ZERO 2 Top Fill Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 89mm x 31.8mm x 19mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Zinc-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 1.0-1.3ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 800mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Port: USB Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput: Direct Voltage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Draw-Activation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Press-To-Fill Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 3mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAXON Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo Load Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercharge Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Vaporesso ZERO 2 Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.0ohm ZERO S Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 USB Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531768045623,"sku":"V Zero 2 Top Filling Pod System","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_zero_2_top_fill_pod_system_-_carbon_fiber.png?v=1741709895"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-zero-2-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso Zero 2 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover Vaporesso ZERO 2 Pod System, featuring an integrated 800mAh battery, 3mL Pod Capacity, and comes with a 1.0ohm Mesh or 1.3ohm CCELL Pod. Equipped with the AXON Chipset, the ZERO 2 Pod System is a great successor to the Vaporesso RENOVA Zero Pod System, updating the chassis for a sleek visually striking form-factor. Portable and lightweight, the chassis is constructed from durable zinc-alloy and provides ample protection to the internal 800mAh battery inside. In addition, the ZERO 2 Pod System operates off a draw-activated firing mechanism, allowing for easy and simple usage for those on-the-go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso ZERO 2 Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAXON Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 89mm by 31.8mm by 19mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 800mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 1.0-1.3ohms\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottom Press-To-Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm Mesh Coil Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.3ohm CCELL Coil Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo Load Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Resistance Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Vaping Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercharge Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Black Red, Black Green, Black, Black Purple, Black Blue, and Carbon Fiber\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nIncludes:\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Vaporesso Zero 2 Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.0ohm Mesh Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.3ohm CCELL Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Vaporesso zero 2 pod system infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0573\/8709\/0059\/files\/VAPORESSO_ZERO_AND_ZERO_2_INFOGRAPHIC.jpg?v=1648415648\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531768307767,"sku":"69d25d4bcf3e5","price":3900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_-_renova_zero_2_pod_system_-_all_colors.png?v=1741709910"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-renova-zero-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso Renova Zero Vape Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso Renova ZERO Ultra Portable Pod System presents a beautifully crafted device built for simplified operations, integrating a 650mAh rechargeable battery powering the OMNI Board Mini and the PCTG Refillable Pod. The Renova ZERO is constructed out of durable Zinc Alloy with small grooves for easy handling, offered in a spectrum of vibrant color options. The ZERO is integrated with Vaporesso's OMNI Board Mini, enable by a single ON\/OFF button mechanism with a suite of functions such as Auto Temperature Control and a suite of safety protections. It is powered by a built-in rechargeable 650mAh battery, with colorful LED light indicator to provide instant battery life feedback and capable of fast-charging via micro USB port located on the base. The ZERO All-in-One Kit utilizes a CCELL Coil with ceramic heating elements for a flavorful and consistent vape with longer-lasting capability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eVaporesso Renova ZERO Ultra Portable Kit Features:\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 74.9mm by 40mm by 16mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAll-In-One System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntelligent OMNI Board Mini\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.6mL Juice Capacity - PCTG Refillable Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 650mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 7-12.5W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMinimum Resistance: 1.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAuto Temperature Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Liquid Detection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDirect Voltage Based Output\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eON\/OFF Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColorful LED Light Battery Indicator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress-to-Fill (PTF) Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso CCELL Coil Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1A Micro USB Charging Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo Load Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Resistance Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercharge Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eESD Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePass-Through Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNote: Install and Prime Coil Before Use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 ZERO System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.3ohm CCELL Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 USB Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Instructional Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Vaporesso Renova Zero Pod System","offer_id":41531768373303,"sku":"Vaporesso Renova Zero Vape Pod System","price":2500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Vaporesso Renova Zero Pod System (One Extra Mesh Pod)","offer_id":41531768406071,"sku":"Vaporesso Renova Zero Vape Pod System-2","price":3000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_renova_zero_pod_system_packaging_content.jpg?v=1741709920"},{"product_id":"smok-novo-2x-20w-pod-system","title":"SMOK NOVO 2X 20W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK Novo 2X Pod System, featuring an 800mAh battery, integrated 0.9ohm Meshed Pod, and is compatible with all previous Novo Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"SMOK NOVO 2 Replacement Pods\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-novo-2-replacement-pods\"\u003eNovo 2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the SMOK Novo 2X Kit delivers a slim and portable form-factor, fitting neatly into the pocket, purse, or bookbag. Utilizing two different wattage output schemes, the NOVO 2X Pod System intelligently reads the resistance of the installed pod and outputs the perfect wattage to fully unlock the flavors of your favorite eJuice or nicotine salt. Holding up to 2mL within the refillable pod, the Novo 2X is great for those that are busy or traveling.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK Novo 2X Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 97mm by 24.5mm by 14.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 800mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range \u0026lt; 0.7ohm: 12-20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range \u0026gt; 0.7ohm: 4-14W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 3.0-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.6-2.5ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Control Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK Novo 2X Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.9ohm Meshed MTL Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with Novo, Novo 2, Novo 2S, and Novo 2X Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Novo 2X Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.9ohm Novo 2X Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531768700983,"sku":"69d25d4bc578f","price":3900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_-_novo_2x_-_pod_system_-_black_cobra.png?v=1741709979"},{"product_id":"smok-novo-4-mini-25w-pod-kit","title":"SMOK Novo 4 Mini 25W Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the SMOK NOVO 4 Mini 25W Kit, the latest NOVO reiteration, featuring an integrated 900mAh battery, 6-25W output range, and adjustable airflow dial.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003eSMOK NOVO 4 Mini Replacement Pods\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/products\/novo_4_MINI_INFOGRAPHIC.jpg?v=1681421446\" alt=\"smok novo 4 mini pod kit infographic\" style=\"float: none;\" data-mce-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/products\/novo_4_MINI_INFOGRAPHIC.jpg?v=1681421446\" data-mce-style=\"float: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with an internal 900mAh battery, the NOVO 4 Mini increases the battery size than its regular sized sibling, increasing the battery capacity by 100mAh. Outputting between 6-25W, the. Novo 4 Mini eliminates the need for screen, instead opting for a LED Indicator light. In addition, the NOVO 4 Mini maintains the circular airflow dial to deliver the perfect amount of airflow to the coil within. Holding up to 2mL of eJuice or nicotine salts within the pod, the Novo 4 Mini can utilize the LP1 Coils within NOVO 4 Pods, to deliver substantial vapor and flavor.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK NOVO 4 Mini 25W Kit Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimesnions - 91.6mm by 24.5mm by 16mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 900mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 6-25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 3.0-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.6-2.5ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Dial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK LP1 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9ohm LP1 Mesh MTL Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NOVO 4 Mini Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NOVO 4 Mini Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.9ohm LP1 Meshed MTL Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531769913399,"sku":"S Novo 4 Mini Pod Kit","price":4190.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_-_novo_4_mini_-_pod_system_-_all_colors.png?v=1741709992"},{"product_id":"smok-novo-2-25w-pod-system","title":"SMOK NOVO 2 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the SMOK NOVO 2 Pod System, integrating an enhanced 800mAh battery capacity with user-friendly, draw-activated mechanism to power the new Mesh and MTL coil technology.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRevitalizing the original chassis and exterior with a livelier finish, the NOVO 2 raises the capacity of the battery life within to a whopping 800mAh to ensure the battery lasts throughout the day. Acting upon a draw-activated firing mechanism, the NOVO 2 Pod System works with the 1.0ohm Mesh Pod and 1.4ohm MTL Pod to vaporize regular eJuice or \u003ca title=\"nicotine salts\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\"\u003enicotine salts\u003c\/a\u003e, respectively. Within the pods, 2mL of today's most popular juices can be stored for immediate and later vaping, creating dense flavored vaporous clouds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK NOVO 2 Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 88.3mm by 24.5mm by 14.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 800mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 6-25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 3.0-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eErgonomic Mouthpiece\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK NOVO 2 Pod Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm Mesh Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.4ohm MTL Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpdated Airflow Pathing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePush Fit Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8s Overtime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottom MicroUSB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NOVO 2 Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NOVO 2 Mesh Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NOVO 2 MTL Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 USB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531770306615,"sku":"S NOVO 2 Pod System","price":3100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_novo_2_25w_pod_system_-_carbon_fiber_and_stabwood_colors.jpg?v=1741710004"},{"product_id":"smok-novo-kit","title":"SMOK Novo Open Pod Kit - Vape","description":"The SMOK NOVO is an incredibly pocket-friendly vape kit with press fit 1.2O, 2mL refillable cartridge, and 450mAh internal cell. The NOVO features a button-less draw activated firing system capable of 10 to 16W, and the replaceable pods have a built-in coil and ergonomic mouthpiece.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 88.3mm (h) x 24.3mm (w) x 14.3mm (d)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 40g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 450mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInput Voltage: 3.3V - 4.2V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput Wattage: 10W - 16W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable Open Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-Juice Capacity: 2mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicro USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531770372151,"sku":"SMOK NOVO OPEN-POD KIT- 450mAH","price":2555.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/SMOK-Novo-All-In-One-Starter-Kit-05_grande_2267116e-e956-41bb-866c-4a1df431b7ba.jpg?v=1741710010"},{"product_id":"smok-novo-4-25w-pod-kit","title":"SMOK Novo 4 25W Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK NOVO 4 25W Pod Kit, featuring a 5-25W range, adjustable airflow, and equipped with the LP1 Coil Series. Search for the best vape gears and wide selection of E-Liquids at your favorite online vape shop!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNote: The pods are not compatible with other NOVO series.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Smok Novo 4 Empty Pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-novo-4-empty-pods\"\u003eSMOK NOVO 4 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"SMOK LP1 Replacement Coils\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-lp1-replacement-coils\"\u003eSMOK LP1 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0656\/8630\/7047\/files\/NOVO_4_INFOGRAPHIC.jpg?v=1662469625\" alt=\"novo 4 infographic\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdopting an adjustable airflow dial, the SMOK Novo 4 can deliver a controlled stream of air to create the ideal draw. In addition, the NOVO 4 Pod System utilizes a 0.49\" OLED Display Screen to relay any wattage or vaping information and can adjust the wattage between 5-25W with a single button that doubles as an On\/Off button. Holding up to 2mL of eJuice or nicotine salt in the magnetic pod, the NOVO 4 utilizes coils from the SMOK LP Coil Series, to deliver satisfying vapor without any pesky leaks.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK NOVO 4 25W Pod Kit Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 93.5mm by 26.5mm by 17.7mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 800mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 0.5-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.4-3.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.49\" OLED Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle Button Operation - Wattage Adjustment \u0026amp; On\/Off\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRotating Airflow Intake\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart Detection Function\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK LP1 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm LP1 Meshed Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C Charging Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NOVO 4 Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 2mL NOVO 4 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.8ohm LP1 Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531770503223,"sku":"69d25d4c81d66","price":4649.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_-_novo_4_-_pod_system_-_all_colors.png?v=1741710024"},{"product_id":"uwell-popreel-n1-pod-system","title":"Uwell Popreel N1 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out Uwell Popreel N1 Pod System, featuring an integrated 520mAh rechargeable battery, 2mL pod capacity, and includes an integrated 1.2ohm coil. Constructed from durable PC materials, the chassis is lightweight and portable, fitting neatly into the hand, pocket, or purse. Equipped with an integrated 520mAh battery, rechargeable via bottom microUSB port. Outfitted with a 2mL refillable pod, the integrated coil measures in at 1.2ohm and delivers exceptional flavor and vapor production from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salt. Operating off a draw-activated firing mechanism, the Popreel N1 Pod System is simple to use and is a great addition to any collection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0573\/8709\/0059\/files\/Uwell_Popreel_Infographic.jpg?v=1656106882\" alt=\"uwell popreel n1 infographic\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0573\/8709\/0059\/files\/Uwell_Popreel_Infographic.jpg?v=1656106882\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Popreel N1 Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 102.2mm by 22.1mm by 11.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 520mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Wattage Output: 10W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePC Chassis Material\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Popreel N1 Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Popreel N1 Pod Cartridge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531772174391,"sku":"U Popreel N1 Pod System","price":2450.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_popreel_n1_-_pod_system_-_matte_black.png?v=1741710159"},{"product_id":"uwell-popreel-p1-pod-system","title":"Uwell Popreel P1 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Popreel P1 Pod System, featuring an integrated 400mAh battery, 1.2ohm integrated mesh coil, and can hold up to 2mL within the pod. Constructed from durable PCTG materials, the Popreel P1 is incredibly light and portable, offering a pen-style vape for those who are on-the-go. Holding up to 2mL of eJuice or nicotine salts in the refillable pod, the 1.2ohm Mesh Coil within helps create full-bodied flavor and vapor that will tantalize the taste buds. Operating off a draw-activated firing mechanism, the Popreel P1 Pod System is free of any buttons or screens to conserve battery for delicious enjoyment of vapor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-popreel-p1-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell popreel P1 replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Popreel P1 Replacement Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0656\/8630\/7047\/files\/UWELL_POPREEL_P1_INFOGRAPHIC.jpg?v=1661807869\" alt=\"popreel p1 infographic\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Popreel P1 13W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 108.2mm by 22.5mm by 13.2mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 400mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage Output: 13W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Layer Lightweight Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Refillable Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGraded Measuring Lines\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C Port\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Popreel P1 Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Popreel P1 Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Spare Mouthpiece\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"BLUE","offer_id":41531772207159,"sku":"U Popreel P1 Pod System - Blue","price":2600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"WHITE","offer_id":41531772239927,"sku":"U Popreel P1 Pod System - White","price":2600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_popreel_p1_-_pod_system_-_packaging.png?v=1741710170"},{"product_id":"smok-solus-g-box-pod-kit","title":"SMOK Solus G-BOX Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eSMOK SOLUS G-BOX Kit features a 700mAh internal battery with max 20W output, compatible with a Solus refillable 0.9ohm pod cartridge that accommodates 2.5ml of vape juice. The 5-20W output range and the airflow draw-activity mode are suitable for the vaper who loves MTL or RDL vaping mode. The PCTG material ensures lightweight while making G-BOX more robust and durable. The pod designed with a magnet design for easy replacement helps to lock and can securely without loosening, making the coil heat quickly. It is equipped with a Type-C charging port that you can enjoy a nice flavor after only 15 minutes of charging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Solus g-box infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0615\/0343\/8900\/files\/smok-solus-g-box__2.jpg?v=1700522155\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSolus G-Box Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e700mAh Internal Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput Range Of 5-20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable 2.5ml Vape Juice Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Lights\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact and Easy-to-use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAir Draw-activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL and RDL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExtensive Security Protection Functions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 71.9* 53* 19mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 700mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: SOLUS 0.9ohm Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePower Range: Max 20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2.5ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-c Charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMOK Solus G-BOX Kit Package List:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x SMOK SOLUS G-BOX Device(700mAh)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x SOLUS Meshed 0.9ohm Pod(2.5ml)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41574754385975,"sku":"20","price":3750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok-solus-g-box-kit.jpg?v=1743120626"},{"product_id":"uwell-whirl-s2-pod-kit","title":"Uwell Whirl S2 Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Whirl S2 Pod Kit, featuring a 900mAh battery, 3.5mL pod capacity, and utilizes the Whirl S2 Coil Series to deliver delicious vapor.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUwell Whirl S2 Pods\u003cbr\u003eUwell Whirl S2 Coils\u003cbr\u003eUwell Whirl S Coils\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eConstructed from durable aluminum-alloy, the chassis of the Whirl S2 Pod Kit is sleek and visually striking, while maintaining a lightweight and portable form-factor. Holding up to 3.5mL of eJuice or nicotine salts within the bottom filled pod, the Whirl S2 Pod System can be used throughout the day without needing a refill. With replaceable coils, the Whirl S2 calls upon the new Whirl S2 Coil Series, but is still compatible with Whirl S Coils.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Whirl S2 Pod Kit Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 105mm by 20.5mm by 20.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 900mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Wattage: 17W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.8\/1.2ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 3.5mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Bottom - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Whirl S2 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm Whirl S2 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with Whirl S Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAirflow: Rotate Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrip Tip: 510 or Fiber Filter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Whirl S2 Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Whirl S2 Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 510 Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Whirl S2 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Whirl S Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Whirl S2 Filter Tips\u003c\/