System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 72.2mm by 46.6mm by 16.6mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 690mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Range: 18W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Aluminum-Alloy Chassis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: Caliburn G\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Installation: Press-Fit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: Caliburn G and G2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHaptic Feedback\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrecision Airflow Adjustment\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Lights\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn GK2 (Vision) Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn G2 Cartridge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Caliburn G Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Caliburn G2 Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Lanyard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652527759415,"sku":"U Cali GK2 (Vision) Pod System","price":4550.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_gk2_vision_pod_system_-_limpid_black.png?v=1746637969"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-gk2-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn GK2 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Uwell Caliburn GK2 Pod System, featuring an integrated 690mAh battery, 18W maximum output, and can utilize the Caliburn G \u0026amp; G2 Coil Series. Constructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the Uwell Caliburn GK2 is designed to be portable, while delivering delicious flavor and vapor. Holding up to 2mL of eJuice or nicotine salts, the Caliburn GK2 Pod System is equipped with a draw-activated firing mechanism, allowing for a chassis free of any buttons. Adopting a LED indicator light with haptic feedback, the GK2 Pod System is intuitive and makes for a great travel pod system for those that are on-the-go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"Uwell Caliburn GK2 Pod System infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0573\/8709\/0059\/files\/Uwell_Caliburn_GK2_Infographic.jpg?v=1657285440\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Caliburn GK2 18W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 72.2mm by 46.6mm by 16.3mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 690mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage Output: 18W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanyard Attachment Point\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G \u0026amp; G2 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm UN2 Meshed-H G Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm UN2 Meshed-H G2 Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress-Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHaptic Feedback\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn GK2 Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm UN2 Meshed-H Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm UN2 Meshed-H Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Lanyard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652527792183,"sku":"U Cali GK2 Pod System","price":4100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_gk2_-_pod_system_-_all_colors_1.png?v=1746637978"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-x-20w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn X 20W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn X 20W Pod System, featuring an integrated 850mAh battery, 5-20W output range, and is compatible with both G\/G2 Coils.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-x-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn X Replacement Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn X Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G Replacement Coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G2 Replacement Coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Uwell Caliburn X Pod System\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/Uwell_Caliburn_X_Pod_Systems_-_Infographic.jpg?v=1669764421\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable aluminum-alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn X Pod System offers a strong and resilient chassis against light falls and drops. Equipped with an 850mAh battery, the integrated battery delivers plenty of vapor throughout the day, allowing the Uwell Caliburn X to output 5-20W easily. In addition, the refillable pods hold up to 3mL, and utilizes a juice viewing window to ensure a minimum fill level to prevent any dry hits or burning of the coil.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Caliburn X 20W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 107.4mm by 27.5mm by 15.6mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery: Integrated 850mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Range: 5-20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJuice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOLED Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 3mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G\/G2 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm Caliburn G2 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntelligent Resistance Detection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Power Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8s Vaping Overtime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn X\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn X Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Caliburn G Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Caliburn G2 Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673630777399,"sku":"U Cali X Pod System","price":4700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_x_-_pod_system_-_screen.png?v=1747872205"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-a2-15w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn A2 15W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn A2 15W Pod System, featuring an integrated 520mAh battery, 15W maximum output, and uses the new 0.9ohm Caliburn A2 Pods. Constructed from durable aluminum alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn A2 Pod System encases an integrated 520mAh rechargeable battery. Delivering up to 15W output, the constant voltage output is stable and produces delicious flavor from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts. Outfitted with a LED battery life indicator light, the Caliburn A2 Pod System can be fired via button or draw-activated mechanisms, producing exquisite vapor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"uwell caliburn a2 pod system\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0480\/2061\/9416\/files\/caliburn_a2_infographic.jpg?v=1645221052\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell Caliburn A2 15W Pod System Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 110mm by 21.3mm by 11.7mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 520mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Wattage Output: 15W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button - Draw or Button Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9ohm UN2 Meshed Coil Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-Liquid Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8S Timeout Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Circuit Prompt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Blue, Green, Black, Grey, Iris Purple, Orange\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nIncludes:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn A2 Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.9ohm Caliburn A2 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673630842935,"sku":"U Cali A2 Pod System","price":3560.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_a2_-_pod_system_-_sample_-_all_colors.png?v=1747872213"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-gk3-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn GK3 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn GK3 pod kit is a pocket-friendly vape, ideal for new and seasoned vapers alike. It contains a built-in 900mAh battery, which offers plenty of vaping before needing to be recharged. Delivering a 5-25W power output range, the GK3 is a solid option for both MTL (Mouth To Lung) and RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) vaping. This kit is compatible with the refillable Caliburn G3 pods and two 2ml pods are also included to help get you started.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e900mAh Built-In Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5-25W Output Range\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL And RDTL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInhale Activation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVariable Wattage Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml Refillable Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop-Filling Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe GK3 boasts single-button operation and you can get started with five quick clicks. When unlocked, vape by either pressing the button or just inhaling on the mouthpiece. The device’s smart, built-in chipset recognises your coil’s resistance and selects the best power output automatically, helping your pods last longer and removing the need for any guesswork. If you’re looking for extra customisation, you can also set a power level manually and discover your perfect vape. However you decide to vape, keep track of power and battery life easily with the GK3’s built-in OLED display.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Caliburn G3 pods hold up to 2ml of e-liquid and boast a simple top-filling design. Refilling your pod is as easy as lifting off the mouthpiece — you don’t even have to remove it from your device, cutting down on a lot of mess. Their built-in coil design saves you even more hassle, as you can just replace the whole pod when the coil inside needs changing. Want to switch between an RDTL and MTL inhale? Simply swap between the 0.6 Ohm and 0.9 Ohm pods, both of which will work best 50% VG e-liquids and higher PG vape juice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCaliburn GK3 Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.6 Ohm Caliburn G3 Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9 Ohm Caliburn G3 Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanyard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673630875703,"sku":"U Cali GK3 Pod System","price":4850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/caliburn-gk3-kit-min.jpg?v=1747872218"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-q-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso Luxe Q Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Vaporesso LUXE Q Pod System, featuring a 1000mAh battery, draw-activated firing mechanism, and can hold up to 2mL within the pod. Constructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the LUXE Q Pod System is impervious to light falls and drops. Wrapped in a leather-textured coating, the chassis is anti-slip and anti-sweat. Maintaining a diminutive size, the LUXE Q Pod System is about the same length as a credit card, making it easy to conceal and bring about. Outfitted with a 2mL refillable pod with integrated coil options, the Vaporesso LUXE Q offers a 0.8ohm and 1.2ohm Mesh Coil to deliver outstanding flavor from your favorite e-juice or nicotine salt. Equipped with a 1000mAh rechargeable battery, the LUXE Q does not feature any buttons or screens to save power, relying on a draw-activated firing mechanism and tri-colored LED indicator light, instead.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0480\/2061\/9416\/files\/Vaporesso_Luxe_Q_Infographic.jpg?v=1633049180\" alt=\"vaporesso luxe q pod system infographic\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0480\/2061\/9416\/files\/Vaporesso_Luxe_Q_Infographic.jpg?v=1633049180\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso LUXE Q Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 91.8mm by 26mm by 16.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1000mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntelligent Pod Recognition\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3-Color LED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow System - Rotate Pod 180°\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-Juice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSSS Leak-Resistant Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.8ohm Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Charging Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Green, Black, Red, Brown, Blue, White, and Pink\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 LUXE Q Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm LUXE Q Mesh Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm LUXE Q Mesh Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C USB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673632841783,"sku":"69d25f684fedf","price":3650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_luxe_q_black.png?v=1747872585"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-2-220w-starter-kit","title":"Vaporesso Luxe 2 220W Starter Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Vaporesso LUXE II 2 220W Starter Kit, featuring a dual 18650 battery layout, various operating modes, and comes with the Vaporesso NRG-S Tank. Outfitted with the AXON Chipset, the LUXE II 2 Starter Kit, is capable of reaching 220W, powered by the dual 18650 batteries. Featuring various firing modes, the LUXE II is great for both beginner and advanced vapers, offering a Variable Wattage Mode, Pulse Mode, and Smart TC Mode to accommodate both types of users. In addition, the Vaporesso LUXE II 2 Starter Kit comes paired with the Vaporesso NRG-S Tank, an innovative sub-ohm tank that utilizes the Vaporesso GT Mesh Coils to produce outstanding and unrivaled flavor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca title=\"Vaporesso NRG GT Coils\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gt-core-coils-3-coils\"\u003eVaporesso NRG GT Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Vaporesso Luxe II\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0656\/8630\/7047\/files\/Vaporesso_Luxe_II_Inforgraphic.jpg?v=1661816095\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso LUXE II 2 220W Box Mod Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAXON Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 89.9mm by 47.8mm by 29.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual High-Amp 18650 Batteries\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-220W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.03-5.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePulse Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePower ECO Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart TC Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIY Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2.0\" TFT Color Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo Adjustment Buttons\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTactile Vibrational Feedback\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOverheat Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB Input Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo Load Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Battery Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Resistance Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThreaded 510 Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso NRG-S Sub-Ohm Tank Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mm Diameter - Widest Point\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8mL Tank Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOptional 2mL Tank Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSliding Top Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso GT Mesh Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.18ohm GT Mesh Coil - rated for 50-85W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.15ohm GT4 Mesh Coil - rated for 50-75W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThreaded Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThreaded 510 Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 LUXE II 2 Mod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NRG-S Tank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.18ohm GT Meshed Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.15ohm GT4 Meshed Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Replacement Glass\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 O-Rings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manuals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Dual High-Amp 18650 Batteries\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673632874551,"sku":"V Luxe 2 Starter Kit","price":8900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_luxe_ii_kit_-_all_colors.jpg?v=1747872599"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-xr-pod-kit","title":"Vaporesso Luxe XR Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso Luxe XR vape kit is a powerful sub ohm option that will fit right in your pocket. Its 1500mAh built-in battery supports long vaping sessions between charges and thanks to the 5 - 40W variable output, you can choose an amount of vapour that you’re comfortable with. It also means that while the included GTX coils can support DTL (Direct To Lung) and RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) vaping, the kit also works with MTL (Mouth To Lung) coils from the same range.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSub Ohm \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-kenya\" title=\"Pod Kit in Kenya\"\u003ePod Kit\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1500mAh Built-in Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5 - 40W Output\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRDTL \u0026amp; DTL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml Pod Tank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReplaceable Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe device features one firing button that’s used to activate it, so you don’t have to click through multiple buttons and navigate menu screens. The 0.4 Ohm DTL coil produces more vapour than the 0.8 Ohm RDTL version, so if you like to experiment, bear that in mind when selecting an output level. However, it’s also equipped with an intelligent chipset, that can automatically select the correct wattage based on what coil you’ve inserted. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe included Luxe XR pods are easy to refill – simply lift up the rubber stopper on the base of the pod to access the fill port. The replaceable coils mean less waste and a cheaper way of running your kit, while their mesh design improves flavour. Regardless of which coil you choose, both work best with 70% VG e-liquid or higher VG options.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBox Contains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso Luxe XR Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso Luxe X Pod (RTL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso Luxe X Pod (MTL)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-gtx-replacement-coil-series\" title=\"Vaporesso GTX Replacement Coil\"\u003e0.4 Ohm Vaporesso GTX Coil\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8 Ohm Vaporesso GTX Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673633038391,"sku":"69d25f6a0ae04","price":5900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_luxe_xr_kit-min.jpg?v=1747872605"},{"product_id":"smok-rpm-25w-leather-pod-system","title":"SMOK RPM 25W Leather Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK RPM 25W Pod System, featuring an integrated 900mAh battery, 5-25W output range, and receives support from the LP1 coils series.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-rpm-25w-empty-replacement-pods\" title=\"RPM 25W Replacement Pods\"\u003eSMOK RPM 25 Replacement Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-lp1-replacement-coils\" title=\"SMOK LP1 Replacement Coils\"\u003eSMOK LP1 Coil Series\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOffering up to 25W of adjustable power, the RPM 25W Pod System offers plenty of delightful vaping throughout the day, and can be recharged via Type-C USB Port. Equipped with a 2mL pod, the RPM 25W utilizes coils from the LP1 Meshed MTL Coil Series to deliver outstanding vapor and flavor at the press of a button and is outfitted with an adjustable airflow control ring.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"smok rpm 25w infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/products\/SMOK_RPM_25W_Pod_Systems_-_Infographic_copy-min.jpg?v=1681418592\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK RPM 25W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 110mm by 23.2mm by 20.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 900mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 1.5-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.6-2.5ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle Adjustment Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.69\" OLED Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Control Ring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottom Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK LP1 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9ohm LP1 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 RPM 25W Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 RPM 25W Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.9ohm LP1 Mesh MTL Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673692610615,"sku":"69d25f6c39c7f","price":4600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_-_rpm_25w_-_pod_kit_-_all_colors_1-min.png?v=1747875590"},{"product_id":"smok-rpm-4-60w-pod-system","title":"SMOK RPM 4 60W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK RPM 4 60W Pod System, featuring an integrated 1650mAh battery, 5-60W output, and two different pods to accept RPM or LP2 Coils.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSMOK RPM 4 Replacement Pods\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-rpm-series-replacement-coils\" title=\"SMOK RPM replacement coils\"\u003eSMOK RPM Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-lp2-replacement-coils\" title=\"SMOK LP2 replacement coils\"\u003eSMOK LP2 Replacement Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOutfitted with an integrated 1650mAh battery, the RPM 4 Pod System can deliver up to 60W output with relative ease. Charging via Type-C USB Cable, the SMOK RPM 4 is portable and perfect for anyone on-the-go and delivers satisfying vapor from either the RPM or LP2 Coil Series when used in their respective pods. Constructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the RPM 4 Pod System can protect against light falls and drops and features an airflow control switch for MTL or RDL output.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK RPM 4 60W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 103mm by 27.9mm by 25mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1650mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-60W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 0.8-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.2-2.5ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.96\" TFT Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo Adjustment Buttons\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStepless Airflow Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5mL Pod Capacity - RPM \u0026amp; LP2 Options\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK LP2 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.23ohm LP2 Meshed DL Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK RPM Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm RPM Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Black, Pale Champagne, Rose Gold, Silver Red, Silver Blue, Cyan Pink, Black Leather, Red Leather, Blue Leather, and Brown Leather\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673692708919,"sku":"69d25f6f49d1f","price":5400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_rpm_4_screen.png?v=1747875601"},{"product_id":"ijoy-avenger-270-234w-tc-starter-kit","title":"iJOY Avenger 270 234W TC Starter Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe iJoy Avenger 270 234W TC Starter Kit epitomizes the technological advances in the industry, featuring a dual 20700 platform capable of Voice Control System with futuristic design elements to pair with the Avenger Sub-Ohm Tank. Creatively crafted with modernization in-mind, the Avenger 270 234W Box Mod implements futuristic lines and a large RGB firing bar with intuitive LED Light-Up functionality. The utilization of dual 20700 batteries (sold separately) provides the combination of range and flexibility to create a longer lasting output technology with optional support for 18650 batteries for added versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe crowning achievement lies within the Voice Control System, allowing users to make adjustment with the device through a voice recognition mechanism. The Avenger 234W \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-kenya\" title=\"electric vape\"\u003eelectric vape\u003c\/a\u003e device features a maximum output rating of 234W with comprehensive temperature control mode with effective fine-tuning adjustments as well as Unique Custom User Mode. The new Avenger Sub-Ohm Tank integrates a high-end 25mm chassis design with dual bottom airflow system and improving the X3 Coil System with innovative wood pulp materials and mesh designs. The 0.15ohm X3-Mesh is made with mesh design wand a centralized core made from wood pulp and cotton. Meanwhile, the X3-C1S retains similar material construction within a traditional coil design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eiJoy Avenger 270 234W TC Box Mod Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual 20700 High-Amp Battery - Not Included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOptional Dual 18650 High-Amp Battery w\/ Sleeve Adapter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Wattage Ouput: 234W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMinimum Atomizer Resistance: 0.06ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTemperature Control Range: 200-600F\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNi200 Nickel , Titanium, and Stainless Steel Compatibility\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTCR Adjustments\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice Control System - Highly Intuitive\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUnique Custom User Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMulti-Faceted Diamond-Cutting Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVertical Display Layout\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive OLED Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRGB Firing Bar\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Light-Up Functionality\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercurrent Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvervoltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercharge Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePTC Protective Circuits\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Port - Firmware Upgrades\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpring-Loaded Stainless Steel 510 Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eiJoy Avenger Sub-Ohm Tank Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e25m Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4.7mL Maximum Juice Capacity - Bulb Glass\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3.2mL Optional Glass\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuperior Stainless Steel Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePyrex Glass Reinforcement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassive Dual Slotted Bottom Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConvenient Threaded Top-Fill Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdvanced X3 Cores\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.35ohm X3-C1S Coil - Wood Pulp \u0026amp; Cotton - rated for 40-80W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.15ohm X3-Mesh Coil - Wood Pulp \u0026amp; Cotton - rated for 40-90W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e810 Widebore Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e510 Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Avenger 270 234W Box Mod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Avenger Tank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 18650 Battery Adapters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.35ohm X3-C1S Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.15ohm X3-Mesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Spare Glass\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpare Parts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstructional Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iJOY","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41700846370871,"sku":"69d25fdd0a6a6","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/ijoy_avenger_270_234w_tc_starter_kit_3_colors.jpg?v=1749517572"},{"product_id":"ijoy-capo-squonker-100w-starter-kit","title":"iJOY CAPO Squonker 100W Starter Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe iJoy CAPO Squonker 100W Starter Kit caters to a rebuildable builder's dream, deploying a versatile bottom-feeding COMBO RDA with the 21700\/20700 platform of the CAPO Squonk 100W Box Mod. The CAPO Squonker Box Mod is constructed to fully accommodate the new iJoy 21700 3750 40A Battery (not included), with the option of using 20700 battery (not included) to provide a versatile, long-lasting device with phenomenal performance capability. The battery is top-loaded through a threaded battery cap, with the squonk-ready section located adjacent for ergonomic control while simultaneously catering to building enthusiast. The internal chipset features a maximum output rating of 100W with effective fine-tuning adjustments.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe iJoy COMBO Triangle RDA delivers a user-friendly two-post, dual terminal design with triangular orientation along with bottom airflow and the introduction of a full-ULTEM exterior structure. Measuring 25mm in diameter, the COMBO RDA presents a 3-piece structure with 24K gold-plated base, ULTEM drip tip, and high-quality Stainless Steel or ULTEM wall sleeve. Airflow is cleverly implemented onto the base section with dual etched cutouts where air channels enters the structure and adjusted via knurled top cap. \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eiJoy CAPO Squonk 100W Box Mod Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle 21700 High-Amp Battery - Not Included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle 20700 High-Amp Battery - Not Included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle 18650 High-Amp Battery - Requires Battery Adapter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Wattage Ouput: 100W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMinimum Atomizer Resistance: 0.05ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive OLED Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOversized Rectangular Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustment Buttons Below Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop-Loaded Threaded Battery Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSquonk-Ready Bottom-Feeding Section\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercurrent Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvervoltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercharge Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Port - Firmware Upgrades\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpring-Loaded Stainless Steel 510 Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eiJoy COMBO Triangle RDA Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e25mm Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e9mm Deep Juice Well\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuperior Stainless Steel Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGold-Plated Two-Post, Dual Terminal Design - Triangular Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3mm by 3mm Terminal Openings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePEEK Insulators\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Slotted Side Airflow Control - 10mm by 2.5 per Airslot\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Bottom Vortex Airflow - Angled at 45 Degrees\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e9mm 810 ULTEM Widebore Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGold-Plated 510 Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 CAPO Squonker 100W Mod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Combo Triangle RDA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Squonk Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Prebuilt Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 18650 Battery Adapter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpare Parts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstructional Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease have a great understanding and technical knowledge on how to use this product in order to properly use it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn order to use temperature control feature, it requires use of nickel, titanium, or stainless steel coils.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"iJOY","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41700846403639,"sku":"69d25f831452f","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/ijoy_capo_squonk_100w_starter_kit_silver.jpg?v=1749517583"},{"product_id":"eleaf-aster-rt-starter-kit","title":"Eleaf Aster RT with Melo RT 22 Tank Starter Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Eleaf RT Starter Kit features the Aster RT Mod and the Melo RT 22 Sub-Ohm Tank. The Eleaf Aster RT Mod features a \"RT\" recessed tank design which allows the Aster RT Mod to hold and hide 22mm diameter or smaller tanks inside. This unique design allows for the ultimate stealth vaping experience. The Aster RT features a high capacity built-in 4400mAh battery and can fire up to 100 watts. The Aster RT supports Nickel 200, Titanium, Stainless Steel 316 and TCR in temperature control mode. Bypass and smart modes are available as well. The Aster RT features preheat, stealth and custom logo functionality. The micro USB port allows for both firmware updates and charging.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe Melo RT 22 features many improvements on the previous Eleaf Melo tanks. The Melo RT 22 features a 3.8ml e-Liquid capacity in a leak resistant cup design glass tank. A \"RT\" or retractable top fill design allows for easy refills. A knurled airflow control valve may be used to precisely adjust the airflow output. The Melo RT 22 utilizes Eleaf ER SS316L atomizer heads for variable wattage or SS316L temperature control mode. The recommended wattage for Eleaf ER SS316L 0.3ohm atomizer heads are within the range of 40 to 100 watts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease Note:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Eleaf Aster RT battries are included in price.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease Note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Due to the design of the device, the Eleaf Aster RT is only compatible with 22mm tanks or smaller. 23mm and larger tanks are NOT compatible and will not fit this device. Certain 22mm tanks may not fit if a part of the tank juts out such as the airflow valve or top cap. If you are unsure if your tank fits, feel free to contact us and we will confirm if your tank is compatible or not.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWe recommend a 2\" or longer tank for a comfortable vaping experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures and Specs for Aster RT Mod:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 3-1\/16\" x 2\" x 1-1\/2\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"RT\" Recessed Tank Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOnly Compatible with 22mm in Diameter and Smaller Tanks\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpring Loaded 510 Contact Pin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In 4400mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVariable Wattage: 1 - 100W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTemperature Control: Nickel 200 (Ni200), Titanium (Ti), Stainless Steel 316 (SS316), TCR Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTemperature Control: 100-315C \/ 200-600F\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBypass and Smart Mode Available\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.1 – 3.5 ohm in Variable Wattage\/Bypass Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance: 0.05 - 1.5 ohm in Temperature Control mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Output Current: 25A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePreheat Function\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustom Logo\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStealth Function\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicro USB Port for Firmware Updates or Charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Charging Current: 1A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures and Specs for Melo RT 22 Tank:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 2-7\/16\" x 7\/8\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e22mm Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3.8ml e-Liquid Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e510 Threaded\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"RT\" or Retractable Top Fill Design for Easy Refills\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKnurled Airflow Control Valve Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGlass Tank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLeak Resistant Cup Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e510 Drip Tip Compatible\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes (2) Eleaf ER SS316L 0.3ohm Atomizer Head for Variable Wattage or SS316L TC Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecommended Wattage: 40-100 Watts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Eleaf","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41700846436407,"sku":"69d26296947f5","price":6585.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/eleaf-aster-rt-kenya.jpg?v=1749517732"},{"product_id":"geekvape-flint-kit-vape-mod","title":"GeekVape Flint Kit Vape Mod","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eGeekVape has the best DIY atomizers, high-end mods and high quality accessories, now also proving that the beginner kit is not the slightest problem for them so we can enjoy the Flint kit. Compact dimensions, three levels of heating, mouth to lung vaping, Flint is the perfect companion for beginners looking for the first electronic cigarette. GeekVape Flint fits into your pocket without any problem, while offering a practical method of filling, excellent airflow control and two heating heads ideal not only for common e-liquids but especially for nicotine salts.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe classic battery offers a 1000mAh capacity and fast charging via the micro USB port. A single button is enough to control it. Flint has no display or complicated control and adjustment, the battery can be switched on and off by pressing the button five times, then you can change the heating intensity with three presses. This is clearly indicated by a colored LED. In addition, it also flashes to show remaining battery capacity. This way you will always know when the battery needs to be charged.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe package includes two heating heads. While the NS 1.2O head is a perfect match for nicotine salts with a lower nicotine levels, the NS 1.6O head is ideal for those with a higher nicotine levels. They are intended for mouth lung vaping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQUICK LINK: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #2b00ff;\"\u003eGeekVape NS Replacement Coils\u003c\/span\u003e for Flint Kit.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGrab the Geekvape Flint Kit here on \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/\" title=\"Vape smoke price\"\u003e[YOUR BRAND]\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e today! \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAlso check our whole collection of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca data-mce-fragment=\"1\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-kenya\" title=\"Vape mods Kenya\"\u003evape mods in Kenya\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePackage Includes:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1x Flint battery\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1x Flint tank\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1x heating head NS 1.6O\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1x heating head NS 1.2O\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1x replacement glass body\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1x micro USB cable\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpare parts\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Geekvape","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41700846501943,"sku":"69d2629637aea","price":2975.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Geekvape-Flint-kenya-Starter-Kits.jpg?v=1749517761"},{"product_id":"smok-gx350-tc-vape-starter-kit","title":"SMOK GX350 TC Vape Starter Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe SMOK GX350 TC Starter Kit enters the market in spectacular fashion with one of the most advanced output \u003ca title=\"electric vape\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-kenya\"\u003eelectric vape \u003c\/a\u003edevice featuring a maximum output of 350W powered by four 18650 platform alongside the SMOK TFV8 Cloud Beast Tank for the ultimate workhorse duo. The SMOK GX350W TC Box Mod leads the output technology category in power capability and flexibility, allowing for a battery capacity of four 18650 high amperage batteries (sold separately) that allows for unprecedented capacity range. Per manufacturer's claim, the GX350 is the smallest quad 18650 with the strongest power, measuring 84.5mm by 58mm by 40.4mm in a poly-angular apparatus with soft contour all-around for ergonomic form factor and stunning impression. The included TFV8 Cloud Beast Tank is the class-leading sub-ohm tank in its category, implementing 6mL juice capacity, unique patented SMOK Turbo Engines coil structure, adjustable dual bottom airflow, signature hinged top-fill system, and heat-spoofing Delrin ultra-wide drip tip. SMOKTech has created a revolutionary coil technology with an explicit focus on creating a powerful, high-caliber system with unparalleled cloud-chasing potential, featuring the V8-T10 (10T), V8-T8 (6.6T), V8-T6 (6.0T), V8-Q4 (5.0T), and the V8 RBA (4.0T-X). Intelligently engineered to be the leader in performance and battery range in the industry, the SMOK GX350 TC Starter Kit raises the standard in powerful flagship device. Use TFV8 Replacement Coils\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0480\/2061\/9416\/files\/smok-gx350-tc-starter-kit-vape-colours.jpg?v=1626052804\" alt=\"SMOK GX350 TC STARTER KIT\" style=\"float: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: start;\"\u003eSMOK GX350 350W TC Box Mod Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuad High-Amp 18650 Platform - Sold Separately\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 84.5mm by 58mm by 40.4mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 1-350W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMin Atomizer Resistance: 0.06ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTemperature Range: 200-600F\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupports Ni200 Nickel, Titanium, and Stainless Steel Heating Elements\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuperior Zinc Alloy Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePoly-Angular Frame\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNatural Soft Contour\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop-Style Intuited OLED Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHinged Battery Door\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStealth Firing Bar Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTemperature Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOver Current Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOver\/Under Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicro USB Port - Firmware Upgrades ONLY\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e510 Connection\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMOK TFV8 Cloud Beast Tank Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e25.5mm Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e6mL Maximum Juice Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5.5mL Juice Capacity with T8-V8 Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuperior Stainless Steel Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHigh-Grade Glass Reinforcement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConvenient Top-Fill Design with Hinge Lock\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Adjustable Airflow Control at Base\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlack Delrin Ultra-Wide Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePatented Turbo Engines Coil Structure\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.12ohm V8-T10 Deca\/Decuple Coil (10T) - rated for 50~300W, recommended 130~190W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.15ohm V8-T8 Octuple Coil (6.6T) - rated for 50~260W | recommended 120~180W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.2ohm V8-T6 Sextuple Coil (6.0T) - rated for 50~240W | recommended 110~150W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.15ohm V8-T8 Octuple Coil (6.6T) - rated for 50~180W | recommended 90~150W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eV8 RBA (4.0T-X) - 18mm Two-Post, Dual Terminal Deck\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e510 Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 GX 350 Mod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 TFV8 Cloud Beast\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 V8-T8 Octuple Coil Head\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 V8-Q4 Quadruple Coil Head\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Replacement Glass Tube\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpare Parts and O-Rings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstructional Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41700846534711,"sku":"69d25f8810d40","price":8555.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok-gx-350-tc-starter-kit.jpg?v=1749517790"},{"product_id":"geekvape-aegis-n30-30w-pod-system","title":"GeekVape N30 30W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Geek Vape NANO 30W Starter Kit, featuring an 800mAh battery, 5-30W output range, and a 2mL capacity pod with integrated coil.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the Aegis Nano is extremely compact and portable, making it the perfect option for someone who is on-the-go or traveling. Equipped with an integrated 800mAh battery, the NANO delivers 5-30W output and is perfect for use with the 2mL pods. Offering a 0.6ohm or 1.2ohm integrated coil pod, the top fill system is hidden beneath the mouthpiece and offers an adjustable airflow control switch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGeek Vape NANO 30W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 86.5mm by 24mm by 22.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 800mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-30W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 0.1-6.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.2-3.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTemperature Range: 100°-315°C \/ 200°-600°F\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.69\" OLED Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanyard Attachment Point\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGeek Vape Nano Pod Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Refillable Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSilicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Hidden Under Mouthpiece\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.6ohm Mesh Coil - rated for 23W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm MTL Coil - rated for 11-14W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSnap-In Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOverheat Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Battery Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOverheating Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C Charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Hunter Green\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Geek Vape Nano\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.6ohm Mesh Coil Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm MTL Coil Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Geekvape","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775202435127,"sku":"GeekV N30 Pod System","price":4550.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/geek_vape_-_nano_-_pod_system_-_all_colors.png?v=1752511367"},{"product_id":"lost-vape-ursa-nano-pod-kit","title":"Lost Vape URSA Nano Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop Lost \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\" title=\"Vape\"\u003eVape \u003c\/a\u003eURSA NANO Pod Kit, featuring an integrated 800mAh battery, 2.5mL Pod Capacity, and uses integrated 0.8ohm Pod Coil to deliver vapor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/lost-vape-ursa-replacement-pods\" title=\"Lost Vape Ursa Replacement Pods\"\u003eLost Vape URSA Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis is slim and portable, adopting a visually striking pattern. Outputting vapor from the 0.8ohm integrated coil, the pod can hold up to 2.5mL of your favorite eJuice or nicotine salt. Utilizing a 800mAh battery, the URSA Nano Pod Kit is rechargeable via Type-C USB Port for quick charging. Eliminating the need for any buttons, the only adjustable feature of the Lost Vape URSA Nano is an airflow control switch, operating off a draw-activated firing mechanism to prevent accidental fires when stored in the pocket, purse, or bookbag.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLost Vape URSA NANO Pod Kit Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 100.5mm by 24.1mm by 14mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 800mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-18W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 3.0-3.9V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAirflow Control Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2.5mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm Ursa Nano Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Battery Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaping Overtime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 URSA Nano Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Ursa Nano Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Lost Vape","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775202598967,"sku":"Lost V Ursa Nano Pod Kit","price":3630.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/lost_vape_-_ursa_nano_-_pod_system_-_wave_black.png?v=1752511377"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the new Uwell CALIBURN G 15W Pod System, featuring a 690mAh battery, adjustable airflow system, and holds up to 2mL of eJuice or nicotine salts. Constructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn G is resistant to light falls and drops. Encasing a long-lasting integrated 690mAh battery, the CALIBURN G can deliver an all-day vape, outputting up to 18W of power. At the top is a magnetically attached 2mL refillable pod equipped with a leakproof top fill system, accommodating either nicotine salts or freebase eJuice. Operating off a dual firing system, the Uwell Caliburn G can fire using the single intuitive firing button or a useful draw-activated firing system, offering users more flexibility. In addition, the quick charge bottom Type-C USB Port will reduce the time spent charging, for plenty of full bodied vapor and flavor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0480\/2061\/9416\/files\/Uwell_Caliburn_G_Infographic.jpg?v=1633045207\" alt=\"uwell caliburn g pod system infographic\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell CALIBURN G 18W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 108.3mm by 22.5mm by 12.6mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 690mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax. Wattage Output: 18W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Different Airflow - MTL \u0026amp; DTL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button - Dual Firing System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Fill Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm UN2-Meshed-H Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Rosy Brown, Green, Grey, Red, Black, Blue\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn G Kit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn Pod Cartridge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.8ohm UN2-Meshed-H Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 USB Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775202697271,"sku":"U Cali G Pod System","price":3300.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g_packaging.png?v=1752511386"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-gen-fit-pod-kit","title":"Vaporesso GEN FIT Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso Gen Fit vape kit is an easy to use MTL (Mouth To Lung) vape that is ideal for new and experienced vapers. The Gen Fit kit has a built-in 1200mAh battery and a USB-C charging port, meaning the kit's battery lasts longer and recharges quickly. There are 3 adjustable power levels, and the Gen Fit \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-kenya\" title=\"Vape Kit Kenya\"\u003evape kit\u003c\/a\u003e will produce 8 - 12W or power for an MTL (Mouth To Lung) vape. This kit also includes the iTank M and a 1.2 Ohm MTX coil, meaning it's ready to vape as soon as you get it.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1200mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Filling Tank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml Capacity Tank\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInhale Or Button Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePulse Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis kit can either be inhale activated by puffing on the mouthpiece, or you can use the fire button to power the tank. The Gen Fit kit delivers improved taste with Vaporesso's Axon chipset. By using pulse mode, flavour production is boosted, resulting in a more consistent vape. It delivers an MTL vape that feels closer to a cigarette and will create small amounts of vapour. You can adjust the wattage to suit, simply hit the power button 3 times to switch power modes between low, medium, and high.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Gen Fit vape kit includes the iTank M, which easily fills from the top and can hold up to 2ml of e-liquid. The tank comes with one 1.2 Ohm MTX coil that's pre-installed for easy set-up. It's best paired with e-liquids that are 50% PG or higher. You can take even more control over your vape with its easily adjustable airflow, which allows you to choose a looser or tighter vape.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBox Contains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso GEN Fit Mod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-itank-m\" title=\"Vaporesso iTank M Tank\"\u003eVaporesso iTank M Tank\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso MTX 1.2 Ohm Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775202762807,"sku":"V Gen FIT Pod Kit","price":5850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-gen-fit-kit-min.jpg?v=1752511392"},{"product_id":"lost-vape-ursa-baby-pod-kit","title":"Lost Vape Ursa Baby Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUrsa Baby Pod Kit is built with 800mAh battery with 18W max output power. It comes with visually appealing stylish, and you can observe all the internals in the Ursa Baby Pod Kit. With the design of smart pod detection, Ursa Baby can automatically detect the coil resistance of the pod and ensure the stable output. Ursa Baby Pod Kit is compatible with Ursa Nano Pod of 2.5ml. It features type-c fast charging with smart charging indication.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"description-little-title\"\u003eLost Vape Ursa Baby Parameters:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBrand\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eLost Vape\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eProduct Name\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eUrsa Baby Pod Kit\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDimension\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e47*16*68.5mm\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTank Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e2.5ml\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e800mAh built-in battery\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBattery Voltage\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e3.0V-4.2V\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePower Range\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e9-18W\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOutput Current\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e2.5A-5.0A\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBody Material\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTransparent PC\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eColor\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eRed Clear, Full Clear, Black Clear, Amber Clear, Blue Clear, Purple Clear, Sparkling Dream, Flash Nightmare\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"description-little-title\"\u003eUrsa Baby Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e1. 800mAh built-in battery\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e2. 2.5ml capacity, leak-proof design\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e3. Adjustable airflow\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e4. Type-C fast charging\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e5. Compatible with Ursa Nano Pod\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e6. Offers perfect and loose MTL draw\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e7. Visually appealing stylish\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e8. Automatically detect the coil resistance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e9. Max 18W output\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e10. Smart charging indication\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e11. A nice touch lanyard is included in the package\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e12. Smooth magnet connection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e13. Multiple protections: Short Circuit\/Weak Battery\/Over Heat\/10S Over-time Protection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Lost Vape","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775202795575,"sku":"Lost V Ursa Baby Pod Kit","price":4350.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Lost-vape-Ursa-baby-kit-box-min.jpg?v=1752511399"},{"product_id":"smok-ofrf-nexmesh-30w-pod-system","title":"SMOK OFRF NexMESH 30W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK OFRF NexMesh Pod Kit, featuring an integrated 1200mAh Rechargeable Battery, 5-30W range, and utilizes the NexMesh Coils to produce lots of vapor for MTL or DTL vaping. Constructed from lightweight aluminium alloy, the chassis of the OFRF NexMesh Pod Kit is impervious to light falls and drops. Featuring an adjustable wattage range between 5-30W, the OFRF can be paired with a 0.4ohm coil of either kanthal or stainless steel to produce a balanced maximum flavor and vapor output.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQUICK LINK: \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-ofrf-nexmesh-replacement-coils\" title=\"SMOK OFRF Nex Mesh Replacement coil\"\u003eSMOK OFRF NexMESH Replacement Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplaying pertinent information on the 0.69\" Screen, the NexMesh Pod Kit maintains a lofty 1200mAh rechargeable battery with a slew of protections to guard against failure. Connected by magnetic connection, the NexMesh Pod Kit can hold up to 2mL of eJuice within the side-filled pod and can accept coil changes from the bottom in a pressfit manner.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK OFRF NexMesh Pod Kit Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCollaboration between SMOK \u0026amp; OFRF\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 80.5mm by 45mm by 17.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1200mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-30W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Voltage Output: 4.2V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.4ohm-3.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminium Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo Adjustment Buttons\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.69\" Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Refillable Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNexMesh Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm SS316 Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4ohm Kanthal Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePressFit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOver Time Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCheck Atomizer Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Resistance Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Battery Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOver Charge Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NexMesh Pod Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NexMesh Pod Cartridge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.4ohm SS316 NexMesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.4ohm Kanthal A1 NexMesh Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775206891575,"sku":"S OFRF NexMESH Pod System","price":3900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_x_ofrf_nexmesh_30w_pod_kit_-_all_colors.jpg?v=1752511643"},{"product_id":"smok-pozz-pro-25w-pod-system","title":"SMOK POZZ PRO 25W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out SMOK POZZ PRO 25W Pod System, featuring an internal 1100mAh battery, 5-25W output range, and holds up to 2.6mL of your favorite eJuice.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"SMOK LP1 Coil Series\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-lp1-replacement-coils\"\u003eSMOK LP1 Coil Series\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSMOK POZZ PRO Replacement Pods\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/SMOK_Pozz_Pro_Infographic.jpg?v=1681425247\" alt=\"SMOK POZZ PRO infographic\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the SMOK POZZ PRO Pod System offers a durable exterior that is visually striking as well. In addition, the 5-25W output range works perfectly with the SMOK LP1 Coil Series to deliver delicious flavor from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts. Equipped with an adjustable airflow control system, the POZZ Pro is perfect for all types of vapers and is incredibly portable, fitting neatly in the bookbag, purse, or pocket.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK POZZ PRO 25W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 106.5mm by 29mm by 12.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1100mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 1.5-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.6-2.5ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Firing System - Button or Draw Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.69\" OLED Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2.6mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK LP1 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9ohm LP1 Meshed MTL Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 POZZ PRO Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 POZZ PRO Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.9ohm LP1 Meshed MTL Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775215280183,"sku":"Smok Pozz Pro Pod System","price":4280.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_-_pozz_pro_kit_-_pod_system_-_all_colors.png?v=1752512495"},{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-x-kit","title":"Vaporesso Luxe X Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso Luxe X vape kit is a pocket-sized device that offers a genuine sub ohm vape. Though it’s small, it features a 1500mAh built-in battery that provides long vaping sessions on just a single charge. The 5 - 40W variable output lets you select a level of vapour production that suits you best. It also means that while the included Luxe X pods can support DTL (Direct To Lung) vaping, the kit is also compatible with MTL (Mouth To Lung) pods from the same range.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSub Ohm \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-kenya\" title=\"Pod Vape Kit\"\u003ePod Kit\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1500mAh Built-in Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5 - 40W Output Range\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVariable Wattage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL \u0026amp; DTL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml E-Liquid Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe device has a single firing button that’s used to activate it, so there’s no need to click through multiple buttons and menus. It also features intelligent chipset technology, so you won’t have to worry about setting the correct wattage for your coil, as the kit selects it for you based on what coil you’ve selected. If you’re looking to experiment, you can also manually set a power output and discover a vape that suits your preferences.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA top filling design makes refilling your kit with e-liquid easy, as you don’t even have to remove the pod from the device. Plus, it also features adjustable airflow which gives you the option of experiencing a tighter or looser inhale. The coils built into the pods feature a mesh design, which each heats more e-liquid at a faster rate for improved flavour. Though the 0.4 Ohm pod creates more vapour than the 0.8 Ohm version, we recommend a 70% VG e-liquid or higher with either.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBox Contains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso Luxe X Vape Kit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4 Ohm Vaporesso Luxe X Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8 Ohm Vaporesso Luxe X Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775215378487,"sku":"V Luxe X Pod Kit","price":5200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-luxe-x-kit-min.jpg?v=1752512510"}],"url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-kenya.oembed","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}





